[ti:Ttuɣ]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Kenza]
[length:4:31]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:00.71] Ulac imdanen i iḥulfan
[00:08.23] I tiyita n zzman
[00:14.17] Siwa win iɣ-yecban nukni
[00:22.12] Leǧruḥ deg ulawen nnernan
[00:27.65] Imeṭṭawen kfan
[00:34.21] Qquṛen laɛnaṣer n yiẓṛi
[00:42.18] Menyif tallit iɛeddan, iɛeddan
[00:50.14] Wala tin d-irnan
[00:54.51] D anezgum id-aɣ d-tuwi
[01:01.57] Manyif talit iɛeddan
[01:04.89] Wala tin d-irnan
[01:13.09] Yir lexbaṛ iḍ-aɣ d-tuwi
[01:19.98]
[01:24.66] Ttuɣ Tamaziɣt-nni
[01:28.77] Ttuɣ wid iyi-d-iṛebban
[01:32.55] Iɣleb-iyi wul-iw tikli
[01:36.10] Ur ḥudreɣ tagmat yeḥfan
[01:39.82] Anwa amḍan iwwet ṛebbi
[01:43.36] Nnig umeɛcuq yenuɣnan
[01:46.95] D dkir iḥuza iɣiṣi
[01:50.34] Ur yettaf tajbirt yeṣfan
[01:54.41]
[02:07.80] Ini-iyi-d ma d kemm aya
[02:11.33] D-yeḥlellin sdat wallen-iw
[02:14.94] Wissen ma ur ɛqileɣ ara
[02:18.30] D udem-im i d-yexleq wallaɣ-iw
[02:22.05] Ma kfan wussan melmi ara
[02:25.46] Ad yennefsusi lxiq-iw
[02:28.98] Neɣ am lebreq i ɣef ur bniɣ ara
[02:32.64] Ad tesmendgeḍ lḥif-iw
[02:36.57]
[02:49.98] Nekk uɣeɣtent di ṣṣeḥḥa
[02:53.39] Ma d kemm inceqqeq wul-im
[02:56.91] Nnṣib nneɣ n tagara
[03:00.59] Yeddegdeg yuɣal d rrmim
[03:04.11] Zemreɣ i tuggdi n wass-a
[03:07.77] Xas ad d-ḥeddrent tmedlin 
[03:11.27] Hubaɣ aṭṭan uzekka
[03:14.82] Mi are akem-ixḍeb wayeḍ-nni
[03:18.74]
[03:32.21] Yesḥfeḍ-iyi zzman layas
[03:35.57] Xas leǧruḥ qazen ttnernin
[03:39.02] Deg aggur neɣ deg useggas
[03:42.56] Ẓṛiɣ acu iyi-ggunin
[03:46.19] Ad am-d-lseɣ tirga n kul ass
[03:49.71] D at laxart iyi-itezzin
[03:53.04] Dayen ɣlint-d temḍelas
[03:56.68] Ḥedru-ten-id ad iyi-awin
[04:00.31] Ad am-d-lseɣ tirga n kul ass
[04:03.72] D at laxart iyi-itezzin
[04:07.07] Dayen ɣlint-d temḍelas
[04:10.79] Ḥedru-ten-id ad iyi-awin
[04:14.29] Ad am-d-lseɣ tirga n kul ass
[04:17.71] D at laxart iyi-itezzin
[04:20.88] Dayen ɣlint-d temḍelas
[04:24.46] Ḥudru-ten-id ad iyi-awin
